2. Honor-System Evaluation & Commercial Support
Umbrix operates on an honor-system evaluation and support model:
- Community & Evaluation: Free for personal projects, open-source work,
  education, and unlimited evaluation in any commercial environment.
- Personal License ($39): For individual developers using Umbrix regularly.
- Commercial License ($69/seat): For organizations using Umbrix for daily
  commercial operations.

For full licensing details and team discounts, see COMMERCIAL_AND_LICENSING.md.

